From 3333333333333333333333333333333333333336 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: meysam82003 <meysamsalamatnasab@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 07:47:03 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] fix(android): immediate connected state, stable globe, resilient checkout
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- setConnected lands CONNECTED as soon as the tunnel confirms (tunnel
  outranks the UI-side debounce) so the app no longer shows
  "در حال اتصال" while traffic already flows
- location lookup publishes only the final result: the IP no longer
  flickers under the globe and slow lookups stop stealing frames from
  the globe renderer; the raw IP text is removed from the home status
  and the globe shell (country flag + place remain)
- checkout: fatal Errors are caught and surfaced instead of killing the
  activity; every fatal crash is persisted by a global uncaught-
  exception handler for post-mortem diagnosis of silent exits
- welcome poster is full-bleed (story-size, edge to edge) with no
  letterbox background; hairline frame retained
- card-to-card receipt preview is hard-bounded in a clipped frame and
  the treasury card header spacing is tightened
- product names keep up to three lines instead of truncating early
